  "description": "UTF-8 stdin/stdout JSONL, <= 1048576 bytes per line, 128 input slots. All output carries a strictly increasing seq per core process. command.accepted means accepted; session.stopped confirms capture/ASR/translation draining. shutdown keeps reading translation results until core.exiting and process exit. No audio PCM or translation keys belong on this channel. command_id is optional for standalone CLI clients; the desktop supplies it on every request. Supplied translation session/version must match the immutable request."
}
